      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">All cash expenditures and receipts are managed by the parent company and accounted for within Miscellaneous Other Assets.</xhtml:span>
